msgid "The base URL of the OpenID Connect (OIDC) server, for example, `https://host:port/auth`. Do not set this property if you use 'quarkus-oidc' and the public key verification (`public-key`) or certificate chain verification only (`certificate-chain`) is required. The OIDC discovery endpoint is called by default by appending a `.well-known/openid-configuration` path to this URL. For Keycloak, use `https://host:port/realms/++{++realm++}++`, replacing `++{++realm++}++` with the Keycloak realm name."
